<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00213">
	<title>Seatback angle</title>
	<shortdesc/>
	<conbody>
		<table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e01328">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e01329">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="images/N_SP327_B06_017_1.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>To recline the seatback:</p>
		<ol id="e01330">
			<li>
				<p>Pull up the seatback recline lever.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Hold the lever and adjust the seatback of the seat to the position you desire.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Release the lever and make sure the seatback is locked in place. (The lever MUST return to its original position for the seatback to lock.)</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00212.dita#t00212" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Rear seat adjustment</linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</concept>